{"originalLanguage":"ko","title":"진달래꽃","artist":"마야","date":"2026-07-20","sourceId":"UBCB2e0Aik4:004","sourceHash":"31acca9a8c2599b34d3508fa5a17f2cb54eedddd6313980499087f608044de13","duration":223.87,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":21.3,"end":26.25,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":26.27,"end":31.25,"text":"말없이 고이 보내 드리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":31.34,"end":35.18,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":35.18,"end":39.9,"text":"죽어도 아니 눈물 흘리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":41.46,"end":54.06,"text":"날 떠나 행복한지 이젠 그대 아닌지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":58.18,"end":63.48,"text":"그댈 바라보며 살아온 내가","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":66.54,"end":69.64,"text":"그녀 뒤에 가렸는지","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":73.24,"end":77.98,"text":"사랑 그 아픔이 너무 커","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":81.82,"end":85.6,"text":"숨을 쉴 수가 없어","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":90.18,"end":95.52,"text":"그대 행복하길 빌어줄게요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":95.52,"end":101.94,"text":"내 영혼으로 빌어줄게요","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":104.86,"end":109.0,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":109.0,"end":111.67,"text":"말없이 고이 보내 드리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":111.67,"end":116.22,"text":"영변에 약산 진달래꽃","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":116.22,"end":120.5,"text":"아름따다 가실 길에 뿌리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":120.5,"end":124.32,"text":"가시는 걸음 놓인 그 꽃을","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":124.32,"end":128.02,"text":"사뿐히 즈려밟고 가시옵소서","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":128.02,"end":131.92,"text":"나 보기가 역겨워 가실 때에는","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":131.92,"end":136.78,"text":"죽어도 아니 눈물 흘리오리다","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},